[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m We break this into two cases:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m - Case 1: \(d = 2^a \times 3^b\) with \(2^a \times 3^b \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m - Case 2: \(d = 2^{a+1} \times 3^b\) with \(2^{a+1} \times 3^b \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m We calculate the sums for both cases:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m For Case 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m - Pairs \((a, b)\) such that \(2^a \times 3^b \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m - The sum is calculated as \(1 + 81 + 6 + 36 + 216 + 16 + 1296 + 864 + 576 + 3456 = 6548\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m For Case 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m - Pairs \((a, b)\) such that \(2^{a+1} \times 3^b \equiv 1 \mod 5\)
