[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=455798)[0m We need to find the divisors of \(362880\) that are congruent to 1 modulo 10. Such divisors must be of the form \(3^b \times 7^d\) where \(0 \leq b \leq 4\) and \(0 \leq d \leq 1\), and they must satisfy \(3^b \times 7^d \equiv 1 \pmod{10}\).
